    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dear magicians.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the exciting world of potion making!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jini has just opened a potion shop, but there are many financial challenges ahead. To keep the shop running, you'll need to explore dungeons, create potions, and sell them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Craft potions.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043950/extras/5036fd8d2ffc27c7633100114bf8e211.poster.avif?t=1751534179\" width=770 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043950/extras/5036fd8d2ffc27c7633100114bf8e211.webm?t=1751534179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043950/extras/5036fd8d2ffc27c7633100114bf8e211.mp4?t=1751534179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must craft potions and help manage the shop with Jini, a magician with no magical abilities, and Lokta Hue, a tiny moon mouse. (P.S.: Jini has borrowed a large sum of money from a ruthless cat to open the shop.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gather potion ingredients.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043950/extras/aa5c20dbb0c82e5e06112c0c67d3f486.poster.avif?t=1751534179\" width=766 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043950/extras/aa5c20dbb0c82e5e06112c0c67d3f486.webm?t=1751534179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043950/extras/aa5c20dbb0c82e5e06112c0c67d3f486.mp4?t=1751534179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on adventures to save on material costs. Confront terrifying and ferocious creatures and collect ingredients using the power of potions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sell the potions.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043950/extras/a5b5547e4397bbda41b1e77142edefc0.poster.avif?t=1751534179\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043950/extras/a5b5547e4397bbda41b1e77142edefc0.webm?t=1751534179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043950/extras/a5b5547e4397bbda41b1e77142edefc0.mp4?t=1751534179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the preferences of your magician customers and sell them potions. Customers have diverse tastes. As you progress through the game, their information will be added to Jini's diary. Sell imaginative potions that suit the occasion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What can I do in the demo version?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can explore 1 dungeon (forest) and make potions from forest-gathering materials. You can also sell potions to eight magician guests and play the main story at the beginning.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dear magicians.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the exciting world of potion making!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jini has just opened a potion shop, but there are many financial challenges ahead. To keep the shop running, you'll need to explore dungeons, create potions, and sell them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Craft potions.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043950/extras/5036fd8d2ffc27c7633100114bf8e211.poster.avif?t=1751534179\" width=770 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043950/extras/5036fd8d2ffc27c7633100114bf8e211.webm?t=1751534179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043950/extras/5036fd8d2ffc27c7633100114bf8e211.mp4?t=1751534179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must craft potions and help manage the shop with Jini, a magician with no magical abilities, and Lokta Hue, a tiny moon mouse. (P.S.: Jini has borrowed a large sum of money from a ruthless cat to open the shop.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gather potion ingredients.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043950/extras/aa5c20dbb0c82e5e06112c0c67d3f486.poster.avif?t=1751534179\" width=766 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043950/extras/aa5c20dbb0c82e5e06112c0c67d3f486.webm?t=1751534179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043950/extras/aa5c20dbb0c82e5e06112c0c67d3f486.mp4?t=1751534179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on adventures to save on material costs. Confront terrifying and ferocious creatures and collect ingredients using the power of potions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sell the potions.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043950/extras/a5b5547e4397bbda41b1e77142edefc0.poster.avif?t=1751534179\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043950/extras/a5b5547e4397bbda41b1e77142edefc0.webm?t=1751534179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043950/extras/a5b5547e4397bbda41b1e77142edefc0.mp4?t=1751534179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the preferences of your magician customers and sell them potions. Customers have diverse tastes. As you progress through the game, their information will be added to Jini's diary. Sell imaginative potions that suit the occasion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What can I do in the demo version?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can explore 1 dungeon (forest) and make potions from forest-gathering materials. You can also sell potions to eight magician guests and play the main story at the beginning.</p>",
    "short_description": "Run the Potion Shop with the magic-less magician JINI and the little moon mouse ROKTA HYU! Inform and sell potions to various magicians in need. Explore dungeons illustrated in a cute graphic style to collect rare potion ingredients. And the exciting truth of the world is a bonus.",
